/**
 * Christianity in Persia (Pentecost to today) — Dossier topic exhibit.
 *
 * Research rules followed here:
 *  - every claim has >=1 source and an honest confidence grade; contested/tradition claims carry a note;
 *  - no direct quotation appears unless the exact wording was read in a fetched source
 *    (Acts 2:9 KJV via bible-api.com; the Xi'an Stele via James Legge's 1888 translation);
 *  - this is a topic dossier, so `characters` is empty and no identifiable person is invented;
 *  - the evidence behind each source is recorded in docs/dossier/persia-research-notes.md.
 */
